# Lease signing & Adobe split

## Ownership
- **Adobe owns everything it can** (PDF Services fill/prep on the AcroForm lease).
- **Neela owns signing only** until Acrobat Sign API is licensed (email links, tenant/landlord sign, stamp, store signed PDF).
- Do **not** use Acrobat web hand-off as the primary staff flow.

## Adobe — blocked vs allowed
- **Acrobat Sign API**: **not licensed** on org `paalarkllc-gmail.com`. When available, move the full send→sign→callback path to Adobe.
- **PDF Services API**: opt-in only (`LEASE_FILL_ENGINE=adobe`). Adobe Import Form Data mis-filled Term dates (end date in month-to-month start, unchosen Standard line filled), so **Neela blank-fill is the default** engine.

## Do not
- Ask for Adobe account passwords in chat.
- Assume Sign API works because Acrobat web “Request e-signatures” works for a human.
